music BGM32A.mp3
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKY08"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s110
fi
goto 112
label s110
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 112
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
sound BI6.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...I love you...
text @[Tomoya]
text Don't tell me... you're...
sound BI7.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I love you too, Tomoya...
text @[Tomoya]
text Ky-Kyou?!
text @[Tomoya]
text Wait... huh? Why?! What's up with your hair...?
sound BI8.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...Don't run away...
text @[Tomoya]
text Eh...?
sound BI9.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Ryou told me... don't run away...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Ryou... did...?
sound BIA.aac
text @[Kyou]
text She told me that if I actually liked you, then I mustn't run away...
sound BIB.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...She was mad at me...
text She smiles... seemingly troubled... yet happy.
sound BIC.aac
text @[Kyou]
text She said... she's sorry.
sound BID.aac
text @[Kyou]
text To you...
sound BIE.aac
text @[Kyou]
text And also... to me...
sound BIF.aac
text @[Kyou]
text She said she did something really terrible.
sound BIG.aac
text @[Kyou]
text That she only thought for herself, and hurt the two of us...
sound BIH.aac
text @[Kyou]
text That she did nothing but be spoiled by our gentleness...
sound BII.aac
text @[Kyou]
text And that... she made things so difficult for us...
text @[Tomoya]
text No! I am the one who made things difficult!
text @[Tomoya]
text And it was me who was spoiled and hurt everyone!
text @[Tomoya]
text I was so fixated on staying where I felt comfortable, I didn't consider either of your feelings...
text @[Tomoya]
text ...and brought you two such painful memories...
text @[Tomoya]
text It's me who's is terrible and underhanded.
sound BIJ.aac
text @[Kyou]
text No...
sound BIK.aac
text @[Kyou]
text No...
sound BIL.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Actually, none of us are...
sound BIM.aac
text @[Kyou]
text It's nothing that's good or bad...
sound BIN.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I realized that when the two of us fell in love with the same person, one of us was going to be hurt...
sound BIO.aac
text @[Kyou]
text That's why...
sound BIP.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...I thought I would try to bear it if it meant Ryou could keep smiling...
sound BIQ.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I thought that was better than confessing to you and getting rejected...
sound BIR.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I thought I could bear it better than the pain of being rejected...
sound BIS.aac
text @[Kyou]
text But...
sound BIT.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...It was no good...
sound BIU.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I couldn't keep going forward while saying no to my own feelings.
sound BIV.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Not only that... I couldn't even stay where I was...
sound BIW.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...and chose to run away...
sound BIX.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I felt depressed...
sound BIY.aac
text @[Kyou]
text And then Ryou got mad at me.
sound BIZ.aac
text @[Kyou]
text She told me that I can't run away.
sound BJ0.aac
text @[Kyou]
text She said that if I were to feel down, I should feel down for getting rejected...
sound BJ1.aac
text @[Kyou]
text And she said she would cry with me if that happens...
sound BJ2.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Ryou... was almost tearing up... but she still said that with a smile.
sound BJ3.aac
text @[Kyou]
text That's why...!
sound BJ4.aac
text @[Kyou]
text That's why... I...
sound BJ5.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I can't... anymore...
text @[Tomoya]
text Kyou...
sound BJ6.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Tomoya...
text Kyou firmly closes her eyes.
text As if she's hesitating...
text And as if she's resisting...
text She slowly breathes in, and slowly breathes out...
text She opens her eyes.
text Then... with a strong will behind her eyes, she looks at me.
sound BJ7.aac
text @[Kyou]
text I love you.
sound BJ8.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...I've always...
sound BJ9.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ...I've always loved you, Tomoya...
text Her intent look, filled with her feelings, pierces through me.
text I can feel something warm suddenly strike my heart and spread through my body.
text I take the small package with the pendant out of my pocket, and hand it to Kyou.
text @[Tomoya]
text I bought this for Ryou, but... I got the gemstone wrong...
text @[Tomoya]
text I could only remember the one that you wanted...
text @[Tomoya]
text Now that I think about it... I might already have made my decision back then...
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm so absurd... seriously...
sound BJA.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Tomoya...
text @[Tomoya]
text But...
text @[Tomoya]
text If you don't mind me being like this, I want to be there next to you.
text @[Tomoya]
text No... guess I said that wrong...
text @[Tomoya]
text I love you.
text @[Tomoya]
text Let me stay by your side.
sound BJB.aac
text @[Kyou]
text ─Tomoya!
setvar strS[1000] = "FGKY09B"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
if intA[1000] == 0
	goto s111
fi
goto 113
label s111
setvar strS[1000] = ""
label 113
setvar strS[1001] = ""
setvar intF[1113] = 0
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 98
text Kyou draws her body to me and hugs me.
text I close my eyes as well, and hug her body back.
text So that I don't let go of our very first step of our journey together as lovers...
text So that I don't let go of this warmth, very firmly...
text ...And strongly
music ~
text @... I hug her...
delay 300
cleartext
